note_content = "DATE: 9TH OCTOBER
TIME :3:00 AM
 Dear Dairy,
Tonight  i killed my beestfriend,Alex,
 during a terible arguement.In a painic, 
I left his body  in woods and came home,
hoping nobody would find out.
 But the guilt is eating me alive.
Every sound reminds me of him,
and i cant escaape the truth.
 I WISH I COULD UNDO EVERYTHING.
---Me..."
